    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the Differences \u2014 A Fun Adventure in the World of Birds!<br>Embark on a colorful journey through 70 levels where all sorts of birds await you: vibrant parrots, exotic birds on roller skates! Some are just chilling on branches, while others surprise with their activity and character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At each level, there are two nearly identical pictures. Find all the differences (from 3 to 10) to move forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd4a For kids and adults<br>\ud83c\udfa8 Colorful and fun illustrations<br>\ud83e\udde9 Easy and engaging gameplay<br>\ud83e\udde0 Develops attention and observation skills<br>\ud83c\udf89 No rush or stress \u2014 play at your own pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The perfect choice for those who want to relax and train their brain at the same time!</p>",
